<title>USA: FLIR Systems gets Saudi naval order.</title>
<headline>FLIR Systems gets Saudi naval order.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>FLIR Systems Inc said on Monday that it received an initial delivery order valued at approximately $703,000 to supply the Royal Saudi Naval Forces with thermal imaging systems and related support equipment through a foreign military sale handled by the Naval Surface Warfare Center.</p>
<p>Under terms of the &quot;indefinite delivery, indefinite quantity&quot; fixed-price contract, the Royal Saudi Naval Forces can purchase up to 80 AN/AAQ-22 SAFIRE systems, installation kits and integrated logistic support systems from FLIR.</p>
<p>If fully exercised, the contract could have a potential value of approximately $48.9 million.</p>
</text>
